      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Researches markets and companies with Firecrawl, returning current, cited figures on size, growth, financials and trends in comparison tables.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "you want market size, growth, trends or company financials by the numbers, which change faster than the agent's training data"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "searches and scrapes investor-relations pages, SEC filings, earnings releases, financial portals, industry reports and news, using a browser for tabs and charts"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "a report: market overview, company profiles, tables of revenue, margins, valuation multiples and growth, trends and outlook, sources and rerun inputs"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "the Firecrawl CLI and a Firecrawl API key"
            },
            {
              "label": "Won't",
              "text": "give financial advice"
            }
          ],
          "text": "A short recipe for sourced market and financial research. It infers the market or companies, the data focus, the timeframe and the output format, asking up to three questions only when blocked. Evidence comes from Firecrawl searches and scrapes, with Firecrawl's browser for charts, tabs, period selectors or financial portals that need clicking. Where the agent can run subagents, it can split the work into company financials, market metrics, industry trends, news and analyst commentary, and source validation. It cross-checks key numbers where possible, notes when sources disagree, and gives the period and unit for every metric. Output is Markdown or JSON, ending with rerun inputs: the query, companies, data points and format, so the research can be repeated later.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/firecrawl/firecrawl-workflows/tree/d2a986240f9d786ae54fc33fcfd9ad37308e9cc3/skills/firecrawl-market-research"
