      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Builds or extends a brand identity through Higgsfield, from palette, SVG logo and fonts to mockups, packaging, social graphics and brandbooks.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "you need a visual identity made or extended: logo, colors, fonts, and branded assets such as packaging, signage, merch, posters or a deck"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "builds only what your request needs, stopping for you to choose a palette, then one of three SVG logo marks, then a font pairing, before making assets"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "logo exports, review boards, editable SVG, HTML or PPTX layouts and a brandbook (PPTX plus PDF) as local files; generated mockups as Higgsfield image links"
            },
            {
              "label": "Keeps",
              "text": "your approvals in a local state file; changing one choice redoes only the assets that depend on it"
            },
            {
              "label": "Respects",
              "text": "logos, colors and fonts you supply as fixed, and never invents claims, prices or certifications"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "the higgsfield CLI (installed only with your permission), a Higgsfield account and Python; logo export and the brandbook also need ImageMagick, rsvg-convert, LibreOffice and Poppler"
            },
            {
              "label": "Won't deliver",
              "text": "native Figma, Canva, Photoshop or Illustrator files"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Higgsfield is a platform hosting many AI image, video and audio models; this skill pairs its CLI with bundled Python scripts that render previews, check and export the logo, and build the brandbook. It first sorts the request: apply your existing brand, fill in missing pieces, or create a new identity, which it does only when asked. It then records a \"Brand Lock\": the exact spelling, colors, fonts, shapes and forbidden treatments, copied into every later prompt. New logos are vector marks from the Recraft model in your approved palette; photoreal mockups come from Seedream, with GPT Image 2 only where readable text is needed. Exact copy and editable layouts are built locally as SVG, HTML or PPTX rather than faked by an image model. Palette and font options appear as HTML previews you can edit. It never takes silence as approval, and uses the chosen logo unaltered everywhere. Work is kept in a brandkit/ folder in your project. It can also import a website's brand details through Higgsfield's Marketing Studio.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/higgsfield-ai/skills/tree/27000402070db19d958789d05b3b52b6f4718d7c/higgsfield-brandkit"
