          "text": "The four themes are default (centered title, white-on-color section headings), grace (text shadows, rounded cards), simple (minimal, asymmetric rounded corners) and modern (large radius, pill-shaped titles), with 13 color presets or any hex color, and a choice of font and size. The theme comes from your request, then this skill's preferences, then baoyu-post-to-wechat's default theme; if none is set, it asks. If the article contains Chinese, Japanese or Korean text and baoyu-format-markdown is installed, it first offers to run that skill to fix bold markers and spacing. Only when you ask, ordinary external links become numbered citations gathered in a final 引用链接 (reference links) section, while WeChat article links stay inline. The first heading is dropped unless you ask to keep it. Mermaid images are cached in imgs/.mermaid-cache/.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/jimliu/baoyu-skills/tree/ca703c2d7c2c4399a1dc0cf82224f8551e05a96d/skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html"
