      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Builds GDPR-compliant handling of EU personal data: lawful bases, consent, data subject requests, retention, breach notification and a compliance checklist.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "you're building a system that processes EU personal data, adding privacy controls, or reviewing a system for GDPR compliance"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "sorts personal data by the protection it needs, ties processing to one of the six lawful bases and lists the rights users can exercise"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "code patterns for consent, access and erasure requests, retention, privacy by design and breach notification, and a compliance checklist"
            }
          ],
          "text": "The regulation boiled down for builders: data categories from basic contact details to sensitive (Article 9), criminal (Article 10) and children's data, the six lawful bases of Article 6, and the rights to access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability and objection, which must be answered within a month. Its rules: collect only what's needed, document processing and its legal basis, encrypt personal data at rest and in transit, restrict access and audit regularly; never pre-tick consent boxes, bundle purposes into one consent, keep data indefinitely or transfer it without safeguards such as standard contractual clauses. A separate file holds the implementations, in JavaScript and Python: consent records and a cookie-consent banner, a handler for data subject requests with its deadlines, retention policies with a legal basis for each kind of data, a privacy-by-design data model that keeps personal data apart, and breach notification within 72 hours, plus a checklist covering legal basis, transparency, rights, security, breach response and documentation.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/wshobson/agents/tree/4bde3168b43c0655c4d00ea2726e631719908a6d/plugins/hr-legal-compliance/skills/gdpr-data-handling"
        },
