            }
          ],
          "text": "A command-line client for Gemini's web app, built on a TypeScript port of the gemini_webapi library. On first use it shows a disclaimer and records your acceptance in a consent file. The first run opens a browser for you to sign in to Google, and the cookies are cached; --login refreshes them. Without a profile directory set, a refresh may reuse a Chrome or Chromium that's already running with its debugging port open. The default model is gemini-3-pro; gemini-3-flash, gemini-3-flash-thinking and gemini-3.1-pro-preview are the others. Reference images go in as vision input, so it can describe a picture or make a variation of it. Its description offers it as an image backend for other skills. Optional preferences set a default model, a proxy and a data folder, and a proxy can also come from HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/jimliu/baoyu-skills/tree/ca703c2d7c2c4399a1dc0cf82224f8551e05a96d/skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web"
        },
        "tags": [
