          ],
          "text": "A short loop for raising test coverage in Python. The agent generates a report with pytest --cov --cov-report=annotate:cov_annotate, narrowed to one module with --cov=<module> or to particular test files if you want. The annotate report writes one copy of each source file into cov_annotate, with every line the tests never ran marked by a leading !. Files already at 100% are skipped; for the rest, the agent reads the marked lines, adds tests that run them, and reruns the report until nothing is left uncovered. The skill says nothing about test style, fixtures or assertions: its target is line coverage only.",
