          "type:guidelines",
          "effect:none",
          "needs:none",
          "by:community",
          "stack:git",
          "git",
          "docs-writing",
          "ci"
        ],
        "note": "Its SKILL.md was cut in the middle of a code block when it was split into two files. The Keep a Changelog example stops partway and continues at the top of the reference file, so the pointer to that file and a release notes template now sit inside the example's code block, and the commit type table and version rules are only in the reference file."
      }
