          ],
          "text": "A short guide to summarize.sh, a command-line tool that reads a link or file and has a model summarize it. The agent passes the URL or path, adds --youtube auto for YouTube links, and --extract when you want the raw text or a best-effort transcript instead of a summary. The model defaults to auto; a config file at ~/.summarize/config.json can pin one. Other flags cap output tokens or return JSON.",
